  "identifier": "ecgfounder",
  "name": "ECGFounder",
  "description": "Foundation model for electrocardiogram analysis pretrained on over 10 million ECG recordings. Evaluated across multiple clinical domains including arrhythmia detection, myocardial infarction, and cardiac function assessment. Pretrained weights available on Hugging Face. Published in NEJM AI (2025). Developed by PKU Digital Health (Peking University).",
