  "mach:trainingDataSummary": "Pretrained on 10 million+ ECG recordings across multiple clinical sources. Fine-tuned and evaluated across multiple cardiac domains including arrhythmia detection and myocardial infarction.",
  "mach:intendedUse": "ECG interpretation and cardiac function assessment in clinical research and AI-assisted diagnostics. Not validated for autonomous clinical decision-making.",
